  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">Which of the following ordered pairs falls within the solution set to the system of inequalities?</para>
<para dir="ltr">\(–5x\;+\;2y\;&gt;\;–5\)</para>
<para dir="ltr">\(4x\;+\;3y\;&lt;\;27\)</para>
 </section>
